# Native Settings > Launcher (task 014 P3e): the home-tile toggles of the built-in apps. Shots: the section (Python
# on, first row), Python switched off with Enter, and the
# section opened again (the value is read back from the config). The harness's home grid is the scene's `apps` line,
# not the registry, so the hidden tile itself is checked on the board (keyboard tests, section I).
# Review only: no golden; headers checked against the home grid's (run.sh header).
title settings native launcher
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
launch Settings
# root: Screen, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Launcher, Touch, Apps, Updates, User, Date & Time, System
key DOWN
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
shot launcher_section
header launcher_section "Settings > Launcher" Launcher
key ENTER
wait 300
shot launcher_python_off
key ESC
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 300
shot launcher_python_off_again
